  "description": "\"I can write it too! A sweet romance!\"\n\nBest-selling crime novelist Min Jung-yun chose a romance novel, the opposite of a crime novel, for his next novel. He was determined to write a romance thriller, but when he tried it, it turned out to be a romance thriller...?\n\nJung-Yoon's neighbor, Seo Kong-Hyuk, who is also a romance writer, lends Jung-Yoon a helping hand. Gong-hyuk has had a crush on Jung-yoon for five years.\n\n\"A date?\"\n\n\"Isn't it time to let our love develop?\"\n\nJung-yoon is falling for Gong-hyuk's tricks more and more.\n\nHow will they end up together?\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/961079978), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000118461), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/RS_BL_1)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/961081305), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/crime_writer), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/crime_author_love), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/64064741), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000064899)\n\n**Official Translation:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/163416), [S.Chinese](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc40571)",
